BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.60 Tm (critical records regularly, because cheap subscriptions do not eliminate vendor lock-in or account suspension risk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.37 Tm (Implement matching before elaborate lead scoring. A construction buyer profile needs machine class, operating hours,) Tj ET
