BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Possession is not ownership, and a seller's invoice is not a lien release. Start with the seller's exact legal name, entity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (status, authority to sell, and the machine's serial number. Under UCC sections 9-301 and 9-307, debtor location) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (commonly determines the jurisdiction governing perfection by filing; collateral-specific exceptions matter. Section) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (9-503 makes debtor naming consequential, so searching only a trading name is weak evidence. Obtain current searches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (through the relevant secretary of state or a professional search provider, examine blanket collateral descriptions, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (investigate prior names and ownership transfers when the facts require them. A serial-number search alone will miss) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (many security interests. Section 9-315 generally continues a security interest after disposition unless an applicable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (exception or secured-party authorization changes the result. Obtain a creditor-authenticated payoff and asset-specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (release instructions tied to the actual collateral. A UCC-3 termination can remove an entire financing statement and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (may be inappropriate for a lender retaining other collateral. Conversely, a filed document does not cure an unauthorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (filing. Certificate-of-title statutes can control vehicle perfection under section 9-311; DMV evidence therefore belongs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (beside, not beneath, the UCC search. Freeze disbursement whenever the seller, record owner, lender, and beneficiary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (identities cannot be reconciled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Condition fraud often arrives as selective truth rather than an obviously fake machine. A warm engine hides cold-start) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (problems; cleared CNC alarms hide intermittent servo faults; fresh paint obscures weld repairs; a photographed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (attachment may not belong to the seller. Require a continuous live walkthrough connecting the serial plate, machine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (location, hour meter, controls, and the person granting access. Then commission independent testing appropriate to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (asset: oil sampling and hydraulic pressure under load for construction equipment, geometry and thermal stability) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (checks for CNC, and maintenance records matched to vehicle identification numbers for fleet units. Inspectors should) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (disclose seller relationships and deliver original measurements, not simply a green checkmark. UCC section 2-313) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (makes factual affirmations and descriptions potentially consequential as express warranties in sales contracts. Copying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm ('holds aerospace tolerances' from an old listing can therefore create a dispute that generic condition language will not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (resolve. Section 2-316 places conditions on warranty exclusions and does not turn inconsistent representations into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (harmless advertising. Match every material claim to dated evidence, identify who makes each warranty, and distinguish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (a broker's introduction service from seller obligations. Suspend publication when a serial discrepancy, inaccessible test,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (or material undisclosed repair prevents a buyer from evaluating the specific machine being offered.) Tj ET
