BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (agreement identifies the property, parties, release conditions, dispute process, and fee waterfall. Provider eligibility,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (permitted transaction types, and licensing must fit the transaction; a familiar logo is not enough. A forwarded email) Tj ET
