BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (including accurate headers, required identification, a valid postal address, and working opt-out handling. A purchased) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (contact record does not supply missing transaction authority or permission for unrestricted outreach.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (A small desk can implement the core pipeline with Python's urllib.request, json, csv, sqlite3, hashlib, and logging) Tj ET
