BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (travel envelope, spindle interface, electrical supply, control generation, installed axis capability, and buyer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (floor-loading limits. For excavators, include operating weight, transport dimensions, attachment compatibility, hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (evidence, and geographic delivery constraints. Fleet records need vehicle-specific title, registration, and odometer) Tj ET
