BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (missing-data state and route it to a reviewer instead of inventing a value. Normalize units explicitly, preserving the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (original measurement and conversion method. A machine described as three-phase must not automatically match every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (three-phase installation. After hard constraints pass, an illustrative score can weight application fit at 40%,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (delivered-cost fit at 25%, inspection evidence at 20%, and timing at 15%. These weights are tuning assumptions, not) Tj ET
