BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (from machine price, label their quote dates, and require refreshing when route, dimensions, permits, or loading) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (arrangements change. Test every release against previously rejected near-matches.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Give the LLM a narrow extraction and drafting role. Send selected inspection text or seller-authorized specifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (with field definitions, allowed units, evidence identifiers, and an explicit requirement to leave unsupported attributes) Tj ET
