BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (impossible ranges, contradictory units, and uncited condition claims. Schema-conforming output can still be wrong, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (compare high-consequence fields with source evidence and require technical review before publication. Never provide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (bank instructions, complete identity packets, or unrestricted CRM exports merely to improve a description. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (illustrative extraction run using 2,000 input tokens at $1.50 per million and 500 output tokens at $6.00 per million costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm ($0.006 in model usage. Add an assumed $0.004 for metered processing and storage to obtain $0.010 per run before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (fixed costs and labor. At 3,000 runs, that variable budget is $30; assumed monthly hosting of $20 and monitoring of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm ($25 bring the narrow pipeline subtotal to $75. Verify actual vendor rates and include retries, failed runs, review labor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (CRM subscriptions, inspection, and acquisition costs in the operating ledger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Buyer alerts should render approved facts, not generate fresh representations at send time. Store a reviewed equipment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (snapshot, template version, audience segment, suppression status, and availability expiry. The broker can authorize a) Tj ET
